'''Shimmer''' is an organization-less [[:Category:United States|American]] women's ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' team and a former ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' team that was initially formed in February 2023.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2023
|name2=2024
|name3=2025
|name4=2026
|This=4

|content1=
* July 29th - '''Shimmer''' replace [[Lx]] and [[vanessa]] with [[Bouchard]] and [[Andrea]]. <ref name="shimmer additions">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ShimmerCSGO/status/1685414130105159681|title=WITH S4 OF #ESLIMPACT COMING SOON WE WOULD LIKE TO ANNOUNCE A SPECIAL WELCOME TO @Ju_Bouchard AND @andreabr621 TO #SHIMMER!!!|date=2023-07-29|author='''Shimmer'''}}</ref>
* September 11th - [[Andrea]] steps down from '''Shimmer''' while [[Lx]] returns to the lineup. <ref name="lx returns">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ShimmerCSGO/status/1701350550476922912|date=2023-09-11|title=Unfortunately, we have to say goodbye to Andrea...|author='''Shimmer'''}}</ref>
* October 19th - [[lisa]] steps down from '''Shimmer'''. <ref name="-lisa">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/xIeesa/status/1715210534822334610|date=2023-10-19|title=Tonight was my last game w/ @ShimmerCSGO|author=[[lisa]]}}</ref>
* October 23rd - [[phoebe]] joins '''Shimmer'''. <ref name="+phoebe">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/40769/shimmer-announce-new-fifth|date=2023-10-23|title=Shimmer announce new fifth|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[GoncOak11]]}}</ref>
* December 14th - '''Shimmer''' parts ways with [[Bouchard]]. <ref name="-bouchard">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ShimmerCSGO/status/1735001374100967819|date=2023-12-13|title=shimmer is lf1 (anchor roles)|author=[[phoebe]]}}</ref>
* December 23rd - [[ParkS]] joins '''Shimmer''' as the team's general manager and interim coach. <ref name="parks">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ParksCasts/status/1738665803552088513|date=2023-12-23|title=Announcement!|author=[[ParkS]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 1st - [[chigen]] joins '''Shimmer'''. <ref name="chigen">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ShimmerCSGO/status/1741686750425006534|date=2024-01-01|title=Excited with the start of the new year to announce the addition of @chigen9000 as our new 5th member|author='''Shimmer'''}}</ref>
* January 23th - '''Shimmer''' replace [[chigen]] with [[madss]]. <ref name="-chigen">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ShimmerCSGO/status/1749750526546415756|date=2024-01-23|title=Shimmer is sad to announce that we have amicably parted ways with Chigen|author='''Shimmer'''}}</ref><ref name="+madss">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ShimmerCSGO/status/1749755792449003975|date=2024-01-23|title=On a more positive note, we're excited to announce @madssCS as our new fifth|author='''Shimmer'''}}</ref>
* April 6th - '''Shimmer''' add [[Florence]] as coach while [[ParkS]] stepping down from the role as a result. <ref name="florence">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ShimmerCSGO/status/1776727109005902270|date=2024-04-06|title=We are excited to announce @heyitsFlorence as our new coach!!|author='''Shimmer'''}}</ref>
* May 24th - '''Shimmer''' are signed by [[TSM]], becoming [[TSM Shimmer]]. <ref name="+tsm">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/TSM/status/1794050979815387536|title=We're adding some shimmer and shine to the black-and-white|date=2024-05-24|author=[[TSM]]}}</ref>
* October 3rd - '''Shimmer''' reforms with a roster consisting of [[empathy]], [[phoebe]], [[raven]], [[Stx]], [[Celi]], and [[gir]] the latter as coach, while [[ParkS]] rejoins as the team's manager. <ref name="shimmer 2024">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShimmerCSGO/status/1841901031241777383|title=Our new roster for season 7 of ESL impact and season 51 of ESEA|date=2024-10-03|author='''Shimmer'''}}</ref>
* November 12th - [[Celi]] steps down from '''Shimmer''' and is replaced by [[Fawx]]. <ref name="+fawx">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/55114/shimmer-add-experienced-impact-player|title=Shimmer add experienced Impact player|date=2024-11-13|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>

|content3=
