* January 7th - [[ParkS]] steps down from '''Shimmer'''. <ref name="-parks">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ParksCasts/status/1876660069347254683|title=I'm stepping down from @ShimmerCSGO as their GM|date=2025-01-07|author=[[ParkS]]}}</ref>
* January 11th - '''Shimmer''' part ways with [[phoebe]] while adding [[Serendipity]] and [[Ink]], the latter as coach. <ref name="+Serendipity">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShimmerCSGO/status/1878169428287709260|title=Please welcome @2kserendipity as our newest player on shimmer!|date=2025-01-11|author='''Shimmer'''}}</ref><ref name="+Ink">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShimmerCSGO/status/1878168421336051927|title=We are excited to announce that @ink_cs2 is the new coach of Shimmer!|date=2025-01-11|author='''Shimmer'''}}</ref><ref name="-phoebe">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/angelgun666/status/1877869785087979554|title=i have stepped down from @ShimmerCSGO, it just feels silly to continue going to na without an org|date=2025-01-11|author=[[phoebe]]}}</ref>
* February 5th - '''Shimmer''' are signed by [[Supernova Comets]]. <ref name="+sn comets">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SNComets/status/1887258792800494080|title=Let's welcome some new faces to the @GG_SUPERNOVA family|date=2025-02-05|author=[[Supernova Comets]]}}</ref>
* August 9th - '''Shimmer''' reforms after the team are released by [[Supernova Comets]] following the expiration of their contracts. <ref name="shimmer 2025">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/64560/shimmer-reforms-as-team-looks-for-new-home|title=Shimmer reforms as team looks for new home|date=2025-08-09|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
* November 6th - '''Shimmer''' are signed by [[Sakura Esports]]. <ref name="sakura">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/67371/shimmer-find-a-new-home-with-sakura-ahead-of-esl-impact-league-season-8-finals|title=Shimmer find a new home with Sakura ahead of ESL Impact League Season 8 Finals|date=2025-11-06|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>

|content4=
* April 2nd - '''Shimmer''' reforms following the expiration of the players' contracts with [[Sakura Esports]]. <ref name="shimmer 2026">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/72373/shimmer-reforms-as-sakura-contracts-expire|title=Shimmer reforms as Sakura contracts expire|date=2026-04-02|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
* July 14th - '''Shimmer''' add [[juna]] and move [[Serendipity]] to a coaching position. <ref name="Serendipity coach">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShimmerCS2/status/2077180655679520862|title=With @juna_cs2 joining the main roster, @serendipitycs_ will be taking over coaching responsibilities for Shimmer|date=2026-07-14|author='''Shimmer'''}}</ref><ref name="+juna">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShimmerCS2/status/2077177012377071756|title=Announcement|date=2026-07-14|author='''Shimmer'''}}</ref>
